## 8. Time and Space Complexity

| Complexity      | Value        | Explanation                                              |
| --------------- | ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------- |
| Time            | O(n) average | One array traversal; HashSet operations are average O(1) |
| Auxiliary Space | O(n)         | HashSet may store all array elements                     |

**Important:** HashSet operations have O(1) average time, not a guaranteed O(1) worst-case time.

